(text "Carga por el USB-C del TP4056 (IN+/IN- son su conector)." (at 12.7 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 47abf50e-6055-48c7-8af0-91a5e97b6fa4))
(text "D4 es el diodo del elevador y bloquea el retorno del USB del DevKit." (at 12.7 255.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid aee18097-3ae7-495c-be76-4d7a2f70d9d0))
(text "R13/R14: 4.2 V de bateria -> 2.1 V en GPIO10 (ADC1)." (at 12.7 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4dc17515-85a0-4da8-b1a9-1d75341f1b47))
(text "Consumo estimado ~0.9 A de bateria con tiras al 50%:" (at 12.7 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 975c423a-5659-4e49-ae5d-804cade3045b))
(text "unas 6.8 h nominales. Limitar tiras a 300 mA (MT3608)." (at 12.7 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e294e7e2-045f-4305-982e-0ed770f5a11f))
(text "MT3608: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R15/R16) = 5.2 V en el riel, con FB despues de D4." (at 12.7 270.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4fe0c311-c6d7-4f9e-8508-949d3f70c08c))
(text "EN a VIN. L1 con corriente de saturacion de 3 A o mas." (at 12.7 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 98838a0c-132f-4661-87b6-50ac3cfbfe10))
(text "OPCION B: diseno discreto con TP4056, interruptor y MT3608 (alternativa a la opcion A)." (at 12.7 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d76d945a-23ba-4cf3-933d-3bd83a1c8c64))
